Package: mako
Version: @DEB_MAKO_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/emersion/mako
Depends: libwayland0, libcairo2, libpango-1.0-0, libpangocairo-1.0-0, libglib2.0-0, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libepoll-shim0, basu
Description: Lightweight Wayland notification daemon
 mako implements org.freedesktop.Notifications and renders notifications with
 pangocairo into wl_shm buffers mapped as zwlr_layer_surface_v1. Runs as a
 native Wayland client under the iosc compositor. NOTE: this package is not yet
 built for iOS: its sd-bus provider (basu) does not cross-compile to Darwin;
 see recipes/basu.mk for the blocker catalogue.
